Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.74,0:00:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.66,0:00:23.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-到底是谁  -利维坦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell! - Leviathan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.97,0:00:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们做朋友吧  你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be friends, you and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁愿在垃圾堆里打滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd sooner swim through hot garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.22,0:00:36.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不要和你这种下贱的怪物握手言和\N{\fnArial\fs30}than shake hands with a bottom-feeding mutation like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.43,0:00:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.31,0:01:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.39,0:01:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那就是神之语了  -没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the word of god? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's "Leviathan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:11.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能认出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.24,0:01:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.48,0:01:15.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死利维坦唯一的方法是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to kill Leviathan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用淋过三种堕落之血的骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}is with the three bloods of the fallen --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.48,0:01:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,堕落天使的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fallen angel blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.49,0:01:20.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个始祖的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to bleed an Alpha --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.72,0:01:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是堕落人类统治者的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And blood from the ruler of fallen humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩儿们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你愿不愿意给我们血  -乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You gonna give us the blood or not? - Happily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但目前不乐意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那要什么时候  -到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then when? - Last.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好在咱们还能找克劳力  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing we got Crowley in our corner. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.18,0:01:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来最后总是得靠他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing as how it all comes down to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定万无一失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could possibly go wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-克劳力先生  -你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Crowley. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.63,0:02:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你喝多少  -多倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you take it? - Alcoholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事快说  有屁快放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we get on with this, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.21,0:02:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是想一尽地主之谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just extending the hand of hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.37,0:02:20.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,招待我这样的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}To a mutation like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.24,0:02:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想在垃圾堆里打滚了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tired of swimming in hot garbage, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.58,0:02:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那时真有意思  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a little colorful, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.78,0:02:31.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时没有冒犯你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't mean to offend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.61,0:02:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你突然召唤我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if you're suddenly calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你已经知道温家双煞的动向了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you're up to speed on the Winchesters,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.90,0:02:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这说明你抓了那位先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you intercepted the prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而先知告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the prophet told you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的血是解决一切问题的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my blood is the key to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.38,0:02:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我喜欢你哪一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I like about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不装相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lack of pretension?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你比看上去聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smarter than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:01.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这话就是在调戏我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, now you're just flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀我不容易  不过可行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not easy...to kill me, but doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是对于你们而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially for you lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:07.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们连天使都能杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除掉一个恶魔自然不在话下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can certainly wipe a demon off the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在我们却坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, here we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像一般的疯子一样谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}negotiating like proper psychopaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.17,0:03:17.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你在某处藏了一小瓶自己的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I assume you have a vial of your blood stashed somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:18.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in the event of your death,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.35,0:03:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这瓶血就会直接送到萨姆和迪恩手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}it goes directly to Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.05,0:03:23.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  很聪明的假设\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Smart assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人不能光靠漂亮脸蛋活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}One can't live on looks alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.73,0:03:27.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我提一下我的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.95,0:03:28.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洗耳恭听\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.73,0:03:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你和你的族类予以全部赦免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full immunity for you and your constituency.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我指的是对所有恶魔类都不加干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking free-range grazing for all demonkind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.14,0:03:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意把戒备线划到加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm willing to cordon off, say, Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.33,0:03:39.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和族人可以在那儿做做生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your crew can work your little deals,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.05,0:03:40.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对当地人下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}have your way with the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个加拿大吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of Canada?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.74,0:03:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都归你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.87,0:03:44.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人归我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}America's ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的销售团队靠边站  就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sales team stays out -- period.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.98,0:03:51.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个没得商量  我们需要美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not up for negotiation. We need America.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.88,0:03:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肥肉多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're so fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么交换条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in exchange?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.98,0:04:04.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一位新泽西平凡恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood of one sadly unimpressive demon in New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要求你把这个交给疯傻二兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ask is that you give it to Frick and Frack,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.94,0:04:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他们这是你的血  然后就收手\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell them it's yours, stand back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.84,0:04:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let them come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不承认  我很想看着他们俩送命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't deny I long to see those two digested
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.09,0:04:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:25.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.81,0:04:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你想签书面协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you want it in writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.22,0:04:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不搞什么一"吻"为定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't kiss on the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正好有份标准的附加条款  就带在身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just so happen to have a standard rider...right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很喜欢谈判的这个部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do so like this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第23集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.84,0:04:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  离出口还有三英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Exit's in 3 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.09,0:04:58.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是觉得这是个馊主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still say this is a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这可是你的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, it was your idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这是咱们俩想出最好的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was the best one either of us had.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时是当笑话讲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it as a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说这笑话不好笑  但个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a bad joke -- good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.65,0:05:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还不是因为咱们没有魔咒  没有魔法书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, only because we got no magic spell, no book --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不知怎么找正直凡人之骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing on how to find a freakin' righteous bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:11.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以再召唤卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can call Castiel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:15.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  他光着屁股出现在我车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, on my car, he showed up naked...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.37,0:05:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还带来一群蜜蜂\N{\fnArial\fs30}covered in bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好我没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not really sorry I missed that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...在罗曼收购苏克农业公司后\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Right this time the stock is all-time high
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.86,0:05:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公司股票一路高涨\N{\fnArial\fs30}following Roman's acquisition of SucroCorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.04,0:05:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我说  跟着罗曼有肉吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say Roman's a buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:29.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点我不赞同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to disagree with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.66,0:05:31.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们还是走着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call him a "Wait and watch."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.15,0:05:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  洛夏  你想乐死我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Lawshe. You're killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.98,0:05:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这对罗曼来说是新领域  -是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a new sector for Roman. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.65,0:05:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这会儿就在苏克农业总部呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's holed up at SucroCorp headquarters right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是耐心等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在苏克农业总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holed up at SucroCorp, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若甲方没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Should the party of the first part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.53,0:06:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将自己的意图告知乙方\N{\fnArial\fs30}fail to inform the party of the second part of his intent"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pause right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说错了告诉我  这里该是乙方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct me -- that should be "Party of the second part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.09,0:06:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与甲方相关的人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}vis-a-vis party of the first party..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:21.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是刚修订过第314条的子条款A\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we just amended clause 314-sub-a.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.90,0:06:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专业点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should do this professionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.34,0:06:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:31.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  若乙方...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, "Should the party of the second part
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.72,0:06:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们应该能在修道院找到正直之骨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we can find a righteous bone of a freakin' nun and crap. 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Here -- listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.50,0:06:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·本尼迪克特修女死于23岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Mary Benedict taught the learning-impaired
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.54,0:06:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕生教育有学习障碍的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and died at age 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死得太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, it's a little young.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.36,0:06:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找个活的长点的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find someone who's had time to cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  还有个  有个玛丽·尤纳斯修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, there was, uh... here -- Sister Mary Eunice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给穷人赊饭  60岁当上修道院院长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, fed the poor, became Mother Superior at age 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.48,0:06:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一听就是有手段的人  权力腐化人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds political. Power corrupts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:57.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.47,0:07:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛丽·康斯坦斯修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Mary Constant,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,83年里默默无闻  谦逊有礼  心地善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}83 years of quiet, humble nun-like goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光读这个我就想做个正直的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. I want to be more righteous just reading this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.30,0:07:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:13.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  就她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, I lay odds on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:15.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:24.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把她的骨头挖出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's bone this nun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.56,0:07:27.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.32,0:07:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种情况下  乙方\N{\fnArial\fs30}"...in which case, the party of the second part
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:41.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃所有权力  无限期退居加拿大\N{\fnArial\fs30}forfeits all rights to Canada ad infinitum."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.50,0:07:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.69,0:07:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:47.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.16,0:07:48.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把克劳力先生手上合同复印三份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this from Mr. Crowley, make triplicates,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带笔和公证人过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}get pens and a notary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.88,0:07:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备签了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready to sign this puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是想来个华丽丽的登场吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he trying to make a grand entrance or...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:13.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋  他放我们鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch. He's standing us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们召唤他了啊  他不是得...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we summoned him. Doesn't he kind of have to --
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.72,0:08:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果克劳力想要耍你  他自有办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Crowley wants to screw you, he'll screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定因为他有事来不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...he can't come 'cause something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.35,0:08:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定有好事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们去搞定他  我没辙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You deal with him. I can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.23,0:08:46.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说明白点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to be more specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正在地球的另一半低调生活呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was laying low halfway across the world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.96,0:08:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个情绪帝突然冒出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}when emo boy pops up out of nowhere
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我瞬间送回到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and zaps me right back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.53,0:08:53.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:54.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自己去问他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come ask him. 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.09,0:08:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他以前是你的好基友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is your boyfriend first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.48,0:09:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:25.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Cass, what's, uh, what's the word?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.23,0:09:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我一直在思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dean, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.28,0:09:33.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猴子真的很聪明  它们吃香蕉时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monkeys are so...clever, and they're sensible
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:37.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道要剥皮  真明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}in that they leave the skins on the bananas that they eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:42.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有必要拿它们试验化妆品吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really necessary to test cosmetics on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我  迪恩  唇膏对你来说重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how important is lipstick to you, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:51.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not very.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进屋告诉我们发生了什么事  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to come inside and, uh, tell us what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.78,0:09:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不参加暴力活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't participate in aggressive activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.84,0:10:10.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是玛丽·康斯坦斯修女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sister Mary Constant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.18,0:10:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  你去找梅格干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you go to Meg, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.35,0:10:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走后  我想去观察花朵和果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I left, I wanted to observe the flowers -- and fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.89,0:10:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然先看花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flowers come first, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:21.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没有任何他们的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I heard nothing from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard nothing from who?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.17,0:10:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卫戍队的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.77,0:10:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卫戍队怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to the garrison?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.28,0:10:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于受不了这份静默\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, finally, the silence was deafening,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.10,0:10:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就去一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I went to look...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:35.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去了先知家\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the home of the prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:39.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利维坦可以杀死天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Leviathan can kill angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.52,0:10:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天父把它们关在炼狱中是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason why father locked them in purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.66,0:10:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就是会吃光整个水族箱的食人鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the... piranha that would eat the whole aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.67,0:10:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个卫戍队  都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire garrison-- dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算有人幸存  也躲起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's anyone left at all, they're in hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:10:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉打断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.41,0:11:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果天使都死了  那凯文哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the angels are dead, where's Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.04,0:11:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把猴子从笼子里偷出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could steal them from their cages, the monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.61,0:11:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我要把他们放在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where would I put them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:08.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,集中一点  凯文还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Focus. Is Kevin alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.07,0:11:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.78,0:11:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.38,0:11:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们带走了他  他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him. He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好沉的重担  但现在要你们来承担了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt such responsibility, but it's in your hands now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.82,0:11:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-等等  等一下  -我轻松多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait. Hold on a freakin' minute. - I feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.57,0:11:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  那些是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, what's all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:30.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们召唤了克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  他没出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. He never showed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫"没"\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean "never"--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.68,0:11:36.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到他了吗  他放我们鸽子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see him anywhere? He stood us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.32,0:11:39.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,深表遗憾  不过我要撤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry about that, but I'm outie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:39.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还是可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could still sh--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.82,0:11:41.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show up at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.15,0:11:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.52,0:11:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是各种尴尬啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an embarrassment of riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.47,0:12:01.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已无处可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's really nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想化成黑烟逃跑  小猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think of smoking out, pussycat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经全面监控了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got eyes all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:10.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别动她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次我们相见时  你奴役了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When last we spoke, you-- well, enslaved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很困惑  你怎么还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm confused. Why aren't you dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:24.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想死吗  我可以帮你哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you want to be? 'cause I can help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说够了才是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enough when I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来这帮你们忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.55,0:12:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却发现你们一直在骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find out you've been lying to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:33.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,窝藏天使  还不是随便哪一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}harboring an angel, and not just any angel--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我最想剥皮拆骨的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one angel I most want to crush between my teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在都能杀死天使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so you can crush angels now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.63,0:12:43.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真无趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bore me. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无诗性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no sense of poetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.19,0:12:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么要为自己辩解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what do you have to say for yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在磨练我的沟通技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm still, uh, honing my communication strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.55,0:12:56.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都没回过天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't even been back to heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想  天堂里没有昆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep thinking there are no insects up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.68,0:13:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这里有数以万亿计的昆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}but here we have... trillions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们能造出蜂蜜和丝绸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they're making honey and silk
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:05.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇迹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...miracles, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.26,0:13:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.99,0:13:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起天使我更喜欢昆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, preferring insects to angels, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你  你喜欢的话  就送你一点意思意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. I can offer a token, if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.61,0:13:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是蜂蜜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲自采集的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I collected it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.91,0:13:24.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你精神错乱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off your rocker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:26.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他精神错乱了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's off his rocker-- is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.23,0:13:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是因果报应啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karma's a bitch, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.81,0:13:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来一雪前耻的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, did you come here to, uh, doggy-punch your old grudges
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是帮我们了结迪克的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or to help us end Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.56,0:13:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,选一个阵营吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很为难啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm vexed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:42.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鱼和熊掌都想要呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to do both.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打败这个疯子有什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}But where's the fun in clobbering a ball of wet fur?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等他恢复正常再给我短信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Text me when sparkles here retrieves his marbles, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.18,0:13:52.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与此同时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送你们个礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}...A prezzie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:58.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的  都打包好可以直接用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Just boxed-up and ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是效率的典范\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a model of efficiency.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:00.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why were you late?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克把我关在恶魔陷阱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick had me in a devil trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.39,0:14:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道你们俩想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows what you two are after.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给了你什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what did he offer you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.98,0:14:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个公平交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fair deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:14.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我给你们错误的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for giving you the wrong blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是恶魔的血  但是不是我的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's demon, but is it mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.92,0:14:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,货真价实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.07,0:14:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why should we trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好家伙  别信  不要相信任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God, don't. Never trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我从上一个合作伙伴那里学到的教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lesson I learned from my last business partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.96,0:14:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把血给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us the blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.28,0:14:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  还有个赠品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.77,0:14:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格  我会把你掏空  带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg, I'm gonna scoop you up, take you home,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烤得你外焦里嫩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and roast you till you're jerky.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但...时机未到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not...yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时让小卡留着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass can have you for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.42,0:14:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可笑的是  看来你死了他会很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilariously, it seems he'd be upset at losing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这俩小子还得靠小卡拿下迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the boys need Cass to get Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't they, Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.27,0:14:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...我不再战斗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I -- I don't fight anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑到你对手的特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given the particulars of your enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.40,0:15:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸  你至关重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}sadly, you're vital.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.70,0:15:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯铁  该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure iron. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.57,0:15:50.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-该走了  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:56.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you please let me go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(迪克·罗曼被评选为年度人物)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.81,0:16:06.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待您批阅的PPT放您桌上了  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}PowerPoint presetation's on your dest for approval, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.00,0:16:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.60,0:16:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,苏珊  我看起来很傻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Susan, do I look like a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-您这身形不会的  - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not in that particular body, no. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和你说过谈合约的三条定律吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I told you there are three rules to contract negotiation?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持口气清新  立下字据为证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring breath mints, get it in writing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.81,0:16:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做好被人出卖的后备计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have a plan for when they screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去冰柜一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.55,0:16:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-取那个手臂吗  -没错  手臂  真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The arm? - Yep, the arm. That a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:43.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.19,0:16:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.21,0:16:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.65,0:17:07.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是先知吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you a prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.24,0:17:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我基本上得靠自己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}basically, I'm on my own, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.35,0:17:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点可以确定  我们只有一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one thing's for sure -- we only get one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.71,0:17:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿可无法重装\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing don't reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.74,0:17:30.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得克劳力会不会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think Crowley's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:31.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出卖我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double-crossing us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.77,0:17:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.52,0:17:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得弄明白他更想让谁死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to figure who he wants dead more --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}us or Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那得看迪克给了他什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends what Dick offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.26,0:17:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, so do we, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.74,0:17:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有咒语可念  什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, there's no magic words -- nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.59,0:17:55.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就倒血就是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just...just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:17:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么没有雷电交加什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's all the thunder and lightning?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.36,0:18:25.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许已经起作用了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是给力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些不会令你们有任何不良反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, none of this should cause you any ill effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在诺曼底的一个小农场找到的小麦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to a little farm in Normandy for the wheat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有生菜和西红柿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the lettuce and tomato and --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还对猪进行了全面检验以及深切慰问\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thoroughly examined and comforted the pig
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.98,0:18:44.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后才宰了它做火腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I...slaughtered it for the ham.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:47.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给  你们需要补充能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. You need your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.01,0:18:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  为什么克劳力那么确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Cass, why was Crowley so certain
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.03,0:18:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要和我们一起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you need to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.39,0:18:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力错了  我会在这儿等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley's wrong. I'll be waiting right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.38,0:19:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你们接受三明治  这是我们团结的见证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But please -- accept this sandwich as a gesture of solidarity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.78,0:19:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.83,0:19:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,代表们正在路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delegates are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得在他们到来之前让一切就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna want everything in place before they get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.47,0:19:14.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去把保安叫进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send in the security detail, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.15,0:19:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  罗曼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Mr. Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.08,0:19:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靓表啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换好衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.74,0:19:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他要你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does he want you to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:32.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃素\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a vegan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.24,0:20:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗  波利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready, Polly?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到你们都来了我非常高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm pleased as Punch to see you all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次共处一室  还是在那个天使的体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time we were in one room, it was inside that angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.23,0:21:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们作为主力成员  我要你们跟上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, as key players, I need you up to speed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,项目各方面的进度\N{\fnArial\fs30}on every aspect of the program, 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.65,0:21:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而不仅仅限于\N{\fnArial\fs30}not just the sudden influx
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.61,0:21:17.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各小区突然涌现的那些美味听话的猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}of happy, delicious stoners in your neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽情吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.48,0:21:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这寿司可是新鲜孤儿做成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sushi's made of fresh orphan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.37,0:21:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All righty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屠宰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}The slaughterhouses --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.04,0:21:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尖端高效而又人性化\N{\fnArial\fs30}cutting-edge, humane, efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:31.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首厂将于下月投入使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one goes online next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人群控制方面有什么策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the crowd-control strategy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.82,0:21:38.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在911报警电话等关键执法部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've laid employees at key junctures of law enforcement,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:40.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,插入了自己的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with the 911 call.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家觉得有人照顾着他们  就不会恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone feels taken care of, everyone stays calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收获之前  我们再加大剂量\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll up the dose just before harvest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么都感觉不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They won't feel a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.36,0:21:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(劳工  测试  牲畜)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们分地区进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking a regional approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在俄亥俄州进行测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohio -- beta-testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.11,0:21:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在威斯康辛州加工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wisconsin -- processing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在佛罗里达州繁殖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Florida -- breeding program.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.59,0:21:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翻到第10页\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll flip to page 10,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.57,0:22:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会发现我们正大肆买下生育诊所\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll see we're having a ball buying fertility clinics.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real juicy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么跑出笼子了  小耗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you out of your cage, mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.85,0:22:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我想和你们谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I want to talk to you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.04,0:22:17.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一件让我激动不已的喜事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about something I'm really excited about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.62,0:22:23.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.21,0:22:25.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是波利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Polly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(苏克农业)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.47,0:22:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你收到图像了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.61,0:22:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.84,0:22:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你现在身在何处  多谢  查理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Charlie, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.94,0:22:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到你了  迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you, Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.66,0:22:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是二层的监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's, uh, the second floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.45,0:22:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来是\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.73,0:22:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.39,0:22:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个是迪克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Dick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.78,0:22:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个也是迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:57.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.16,0:23:02.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这三种癌症的遗传特性就是  发作迅速\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, genetic propensity for these three cancers -- zapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.56,0:23:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她现在浑浑噩噩  什么都不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's too stoned to care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:06.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,波利  脱掉你的裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polly, take off your dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.38,0:23:11.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她看起来挺瘦的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a slip of a thing, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.71,0:23:13.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但吃的却像橄榄球中后卫一样多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she eats like a linebacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之  我们可不做艺术品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom line -- we're not making art.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要设计出完美的野兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to engineer the perfect beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.37,0:23:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要吃肉  而这些瘦小的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want meat, and these zippy little hummingbirds
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.54,0:23:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要尽快被淘汰掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}have to be bred out fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,添加剂3.0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Additive 3.0.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.64,0:23:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请注意  我们运输的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in mind, the stuff we're shipping --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会稀释一点  药效会慢些\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little diluted, longer-acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.13,0:24:00.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是添加剂3.0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Additive 3.0
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.55,0:24:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只作用于我们想要消灭的特定人群之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Targets only the characteristics we want to breed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:08.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将加在不含奶的咖啡伴侣和复合维生素中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be added in nondairy creamer and multivitamins.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.41,0:24:08.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.52,0:24:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一批货物明天就运往洛杉矶\N{\fnArial\fs30}First shipment heads to Los Angeles tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.75,0:24:12.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意看关于痢疾的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So watch those dysentery reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.67,0:24:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走之前  请去实验室参观一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stop by the lab before you go,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.14,0:24:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那些装咖啡伴侣的杯子可爱极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause those creamer cups are just adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.78,0:24:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重新播放一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cycle through again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.77,0:24:37.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是汽车旅馆的女仆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the maid from the motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.03,0:24:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What motel?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.03,0:24:42.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.91,0:24:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你想要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Bobby, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.52,0:24:46.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会  你是说鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Are you saying that Bobby --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.62,0:24:48.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你等在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just, uh, wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.26,0:24:49.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you out of your mind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.11,0:24:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有武器  盯着这一堆迪克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the weapon, and -- and eyes on Dick, plural.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.97,0:24:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去搞定鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take care of Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.63,0:24:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.00,0:25:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.31,0:25:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你附身在她身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.40,0:25:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  这里到处都是监控录像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. There are cameras everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:26.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边就有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.59,0:25:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停手吧  你会害死她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, okay? You're gonna get her killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.22,0:25:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  见鬼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.05,0:25:37.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么能杀死迪克呢  你做不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna kill Dick, huh? You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.05,0:25:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说这就足够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.11,0:25:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不会让你走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! I'm not letting you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.28,0:25:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你走开  萨姆  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here, Sam. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.18,0:25:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.97,0:25:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.10,0:26:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.49,0:26:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.60,0:26:20.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很好  今晚就能出院\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's fine. Checking out of the hospital tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.00,0:26:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.65,0:26:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一遍你干嘛为个女仆掉头跑掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me again why you turned tail for some maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.57,0:26:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都到那里了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.60,0:26:28.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.49,0:26:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为迪克制造了更多迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Dick made more Dicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.90,0:26:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定藏了一块原始的迪克·罗曼的躯体\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've kept a chunk of the original Dick Roman somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.55,0:26:37.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让其他大嘴怪去摸了变身\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd all have to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.65,0:26:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机灵鬼  你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, shifty, what's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.48,0:26:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该养只猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.09,0:26:45.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不觉得这地方少了种生物吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't this place feel one species short?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.28,0:26:49.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就迪克问题而言  你有何见解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything to say on the topic of Dicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.42,0:26:52.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力很肯定你能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley was pretty sure that you could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.17,0:26:53.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮不上你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.15,0:26:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗  帮不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.93,0:26:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把一切都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I destroyed...everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:27:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只会再坏事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will destroy everything again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.37,0:27:03.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们别说了行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we please just leave it at that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.46,0:27:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.51,0:27:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we can't. - Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.66,0:27:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能就这样完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.89,0:27:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你把这些怪物放进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let these friggin' things in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.31,0:27:13.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能做三明治\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you don't get to make a sandwich.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.89,0:27:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能养猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get a damned cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.07,0:27:17.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人在乎你是不是疯了  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody cares that you're broken, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.35,0:27:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得收拾自己的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean up your mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.49,0:27:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该玩扭扭乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should play twister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.76,0:27:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:38.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我们唯一的希望吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared off the empire's only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.56,0:27:43.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没想过那些东西都在小卡肚子里待过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It occur to you every one of those things was in Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.01,0:27:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他熟悉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.28,0:27:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能看清他们的真实面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can see past the meat suits.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.34,0:27:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说他能认出哪个是真的假迪克·罗曼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he'll be able to spot the real...fake Dick Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.30,0:27:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该赏你朵小红花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold star, sugarpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.75,0:27:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是他疯了  你可能还有机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad he's froot loops. You might've had a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.18,0:28:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看不出破绽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no real point in looking for a tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.71,0:28:08.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都下载了迪克的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}They all downloaded Dick's brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.22,0:28:09.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们做什么都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've all got the same tells.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.65,0:28:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我们就想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then maybe the question is,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.48,0:28:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的迪克会做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what would the real Dick be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.21,0:28:15.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就这点本事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the best you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.62,0:28:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Idjits.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.71,0:28:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我们不知道你是不是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby. We didn't know if you --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.80,0:28:21.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们该想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you should've.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.14,0:28:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瓶子还在你们这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.93,0:28:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俩傻缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.21,0:28:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们当时就该立刻给烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've burned it right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.34,0:28:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是特别想回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still jonesing to go back...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.66,0:28:34.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便抓个可怜人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}grab some poor bastard,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.08,0:28:37.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附在他身上去找迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}kamikaze 'em going after Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.63,0:28:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情况很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.82,0:28:43.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国是进取人士的天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}America is for go-getters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.17,0:28:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲力亲为  就能创造奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks who get off their butts and make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.53,0:28:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们面对现实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.89,0:28:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差点杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I damn near killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.74,0:28:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那个女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.72,0:28:57.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不怪你  鲍比  真不能怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't your fault, Bobby -- not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.21,0:28:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.55,0:29:01.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just what ghosts turn into.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.21,0:29:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还真以为自己不会那么愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really bet the farm I could outsmart that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.15,0:29:08.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.13,0:29:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  心怀怨念吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Going vengeful?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.93,0:29:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像怎么挠都觉得痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an itch you can't scratch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.35,0:29:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.74,0:29:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去抓迪克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.90,0:29:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是别为了一己私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't do it 'cause you think it'll scratch the itch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.95,0:29:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这当做你们份内的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it 'cause it's the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.67,0:29:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你们的时候到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when it's your time...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别留恋人世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.15,0:30:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.92,0:30:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你们在另一边相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}running into you guys on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.42,0:30:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.54,0:30:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别来的太早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.51,0:30:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.22,0:31:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我需要人帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, I need a wingman.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.55,0:31:53.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  -你不想去寻死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean... - You don't want to jump into the jaws of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.67,0:31:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's...fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.62,0:31:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能去办点小事行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about we run a little errand?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.11,0:32:11.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你送我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.48,0:32:12.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.65,0:32:14.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.24,0:32:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  我们说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, we've been over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.89,0:32:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂  你帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it -- you can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.16,0:32:21.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们去攻击迪克却失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we attack Dick and fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.48,0:32:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和萨姆就光荣牺牲  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you and Sam die heroically, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.38,0:32:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.29,0:32:29.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好的结果  我为了弥补我愚蠢的过失而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at best, I die trying to fix my own stupid mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.62,0:32:33.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者  我不死  又再次活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or...I don't die -- I'm brought back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.03,0:32:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在懂了  复活就是惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see now. It's a punishment resurrection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.31,0:32:36.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次比一次糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worse every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.78,0:32:40.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  你说的是上帝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Uh, we're talking about god crap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.70,0:32:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个灾星  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not good luck, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.05,0:32:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.64,0:32:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果到了最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom of the ninth,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.56,0:32:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就只剩你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're the only guy left on the bench...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.74,0:32:51.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那抱歉  你是不是灾星我都要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, but I'd rather have you, cursed or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.02,0:32:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说  少唧歪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyway, nut up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.56,0:32:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是灾星\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.84,0:32:56.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看我像招财猫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seem like good luck to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.66,0:33:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.96,0:33:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想让你不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't want to make you uncomfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.65,0:33:06.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我听你有原谅我的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I detect a note of forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.91,0:33:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正我明天可能会死掉  何不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, I'm probably gonna die tomorrow, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.65,0:33:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.78,0:33:18.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会尽力而为\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.19,0:33:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.16,0:33:23.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.80,0:33:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能问问计划是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.33,0:33:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听克劳力的意思  迪克知道我们要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, according to Crowley, dick knows we're coming,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.79,0:33:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就高调入场\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're gonna announce ourselves -- big.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.69,0:35:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回见了  二货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, ho nuggets.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.00,0:35:38.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地狱之王要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king of hell will see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.27,0:35:44.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin. Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:45.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能得快点走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to hustle, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.94,0:35:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们还不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. We can't leave yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.13,0:35:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没啥不能的  没事的  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah, we can. It's okay. We got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.54,0:35:51.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不懂  迪克的实验室里有咖啡伴侣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. Dick's got creamer in his lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.48,0:35:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他要杀掉所有的瘦子  -啥  慢点说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's gonna kill all the skinny people. - Wait. What? Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:56.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得去炸实验室  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to blow up the lab, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.56,0:35:57.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.25,0:36:00.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, fine. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.21,0:36:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  我觉得这会成为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I think this might end up
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.35,0:36:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,史上最丝滑可口的种族灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}the slickest little genocide in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.00,0:36:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.61,0:36:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说说而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just sayin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.83,0:36:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来该给你升职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I smell "promotion."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.23,0:36:24.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真唐突  不过无所谓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little abrupt... but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.88,0:36:26.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.15,0:36:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.04,0:36:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你载我们去天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the ride into paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.27,0:36:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And good on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.77,0:36:37.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然都找齐了  优加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulling that together -- A-plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.17,0:36:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这东西不好使  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you don't think this'll work, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.22,0:36:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你信那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust that demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.32,0:36:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定我是我吗  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure I'm even me, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.28,0:36:45.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.81,0:36:47.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.90,0:36:50.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟克劳力打交道就要注意这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, here's the thing when dealing with Crowley --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.84,0:36:54.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他总是能找机会占你便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will always find a way to bone you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.90,0:36:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This meeting's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.70,0:37:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真以为你能战胜我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really think you could trump me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.41,0:37:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.68,0:37:21.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.04,0:37:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就想我得趁你不备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figured we'd have to catch you off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.61,0:38:06.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.43,0:38:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.74,0:38:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时都会有更多的大嘴怪来  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}More chompers any second, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.22,0:38:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.80,0:38:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有一小支恶魔军队在外面候着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a small army of demons outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.19,0:38:20.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟斩其首  躯体挣扎凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut off the head, and the body will flounder, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.39,0:38:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想要是自古以来你就这么一个王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think if you'd had just one king since before the first sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.68,0:38:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在肯定也很凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be in a kerfuffle, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.49,0:38:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is exactly what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.69,0:38:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.06,0:38:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有个大点的计划  利维坦不过是怪物乙罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without a master plan, the Levis are just another monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.12,0:38:38.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不好干掉  但你就喜欢有挑战性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard to stomp, sure, but you love a challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.96,0:38:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的职责是让他们群龙无首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job is to keep them from organizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.91,0:38:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.59,0:38:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个骨头  有个小副作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bone... has a bit of a kick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.65,0:38:49.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的武器常这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}God weapons often do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.22,0:38:50.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真该在盒子上标出警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should put a warning on the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.55,0:38:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们去哪了  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they, Crowley?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.84,0:38:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮不了你  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't help you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.35,0:38:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了  先知我带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Sam. Prophet's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.38,0:39:04.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得到了你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got what you wanted --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.04,0:39:07.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪克死了  又拯救了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick's dead, saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.82,0:39:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我要把先知带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want one little prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.50,0:39:11.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, moose.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.83,0:39:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wish I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.59,0:39:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在还真是有一堆麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You certainly got a lot on your plate right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.21,0:39:19.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你这次真的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like you are well and truly...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.60,0:39:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得独自面对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.51,0:39:47.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.75,0:39:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.79,0:39:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能得出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.70,0:39:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.25,0:40:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.85,0:40:04.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只记得我们宰了迪克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last I remember, we ganked Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.44,0:40:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他死后会去哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where would he go in death?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.07,0:40:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你不是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Are you telling me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里的每个灵魂都是怪兽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every soul here is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.61,0:40:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们来这儿永远地折磨彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where they come to prey upon each other for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.96,0:40:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在炼狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in purgatory?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.72,0:40:20.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.44,0:40:23.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我们要被人碎成碎片了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid we're much more likely to be ripped to shreds.
